“Terraform, look at the Availability Zones AWS says are available in this region. 
Count them. Make sure that number is greater than or equal to the number of Availability Zones I requested. If not, report that the requested count exceeds the available AZs.”

Create an AWS VPC using the CIDR range provided by the vpc_cidr variable. Enable DNS resolution and DNS hostnames. Apply the common tags and add a resource-specific Name tag.

